理委员会提出的上述要求，应遵照执行。","rationale":"本项目已确认为在中国开展的多中心III期临床研究；伦理委员会审查与监督、要求终止研究或受试者退出的表述依据通用伦理条款，来源有限，其适用性及伦理审查与报告的具体安排需医学作者确认。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0a9e98cb500d9ec5","section_number":"11.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:e46b5a64ea06726645d44f52","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:2db65207908661","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:72548c417a8f5c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4e86a5ea954c95","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:df064f51d3d147","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922143346_f6a9d467","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:e46b5a64ea06726645d44f52","quote":"章节编号=11.4\n章节标题=保密与隐私\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"282749d10f5bf62ae8e0c26d7d8766a12ba00d4eea226d71950c5a6854a421bb","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:e46b5a64ea06726645d44f52","span_id":"esp_section_114"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"esp_corpus_confidentiality"}],"evidence_span_ids":["esp_section_114","esp_corpus_confidentiality"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取受试者隐私与个人数据处理相关项目文件，据以补充相应正文。","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_privacy_docs","missing_source_classes":["受试者隐私与个人数据处理相关项目文件"],"target":"11.4 保密与隐私——受试者隐私与个人数据处理部分"}],"heading":"保密与隐私","missin